<section class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">About the scheme</p><h1>Saving together, with clarity.</h1><p>ASUP NILEST Savings &amp; Credit Scheme helps members build savings through regular contributions, access loan services, and manage eligible financial requests. Members can review posted activity and statements, while administrators oversee approvals, repayments, and scheme records.</p></section>
<section class="content-grid">
    <article class="content-card"><span class="feature-icon"><ion-icon name="analytics-outline" aria-hidden="true"></ion-icon></span><h2>Savings and clear records</h2><p>Regular contributions and authorized financial activity are recorded in a member-linked ledger. Members can review posted contributions, withdrawals, and loan repayment entries in their savings statements.</p></article>
    <article class="content-card"><span class="feature-icon"><ion-icon name="people-outline" aria-hidden="true"></ion-icon></span><h2>Member services</h2><p>Members can request contribution increases or reductions, eligible partial withdrawals, and membership termination; apply for loans; track request and loan decisions; and review their financial history.</p></article>
    <article class="content-card"><span class="feature-icon"><ion-icon name="shield-checkmark-outline" aria-hidden="true"></ion-icon></span><h2>Responsible administration</h2><p>Administrators review membership applications, financial requests, and loan applications; post salary contributions; record loan repayments; and publish scheme updates. Administrative and financial actions are logged for accountability.</p></article>
</section>
